.SH "NAME"
mcabber-ng \- a Jabber (XMPP) console client configured in Lua
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
\fImcabber\-ng\fR [ \-h | \-V | \-n ] [ \-f configfile ]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
mcabber\-ng is a small Jabber (XMPP) console client, based on mcabber\&. For now it needs a configuration file to start, so please copy the sample init\&.lua file to $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/mcabber\-ng/init\&.lua (usually ~/\&.config/mcabber\-ng/init\&.lua) and adapt your connection settings\&. The configuration file is a Lua script, see the CONFIGURATION FILE section\&.
.sp
You also need to have an existing Jabber account to use this software, as it cannot (un)register accounts yet\&.
.sp
